# Install the "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) in VS Code,
# then click "Send Request" above any line starting with ###.

### 1. Call our API (calls the partner behind the scenes)
GET http://localhost:5080/api/rates

### 2. Show current chaos settings
GET http://localhost:5080/chaos

### 3. Partner flaky: 50% failures (default)
POST http://localhost:5080/chaos/partner/50

### 4. Partner fully down: 100% failures (circuit breaker demo)
POST http://localhost:5080/chaos/partner/100

### 5. Partner healthy: 0% failures
POST http://localhost:5080/chaos/partner/0
